21996_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oj5iWOa7aHgQ7kNvwF3mGzS&_nc_oc=AdrbTZe2sSMOpLSGHDvLSlbYyytS6y0S6jWGhTjlt7Ay_TyOsL8pKL37YRVSey7wnrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4K2mNiCvkQIHoMbgNAxmseDXtlv0KxHzd_BoKKqkrLcw&oe=69FCA3B4"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot 1.png", "id": "1250575196899192", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1250575203565858_6420430271040368029_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LX1f-NBZNHkQ7kNvwHGJK_3&_nc_oc=Ado1Om8KuQYDjWRpRGzil7Pjrpya4_FATbmTTqTl2KXE1qh51HXFiy5aaQat45GYcV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7xSLuH1TLRlStpVEK9Y8LNAkcrL4jJ3WTcYUQT2egxQA&oe=69FCA3C5"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot 4.png", "id": "1582469119428337", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_1582469122761670_7722550790995415168_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8xhHMdIHmm0Q7kNvwFC-LMa&_nc_oc=AdpEQCvvHjAZXNEB4jYdw8DUwkgGvDQjpJescFzuHe3gxrIFegW32Cz_UitsaYS7ckA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7SD8L_tqL9BiPEtp4uCuXorPi3mDaCYq6azmMAoZqVvg&oe=69FC92D8"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot 5.png", "id": "1363581454936796", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1363581461603462_676098021424155792_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cb8DxXpaE00Q7kNvwEApI9a&_nc_oc=Ado5llR0rf_8bhS0UCjC7eJvc0uEk-p7JceHbPOnOWdY06nE6MHQaPxZ2q1hAGq3O9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7WQrLJFnr1hAPHGDrKtcB8md572JDGKQ4hnEPfyvW4xQ&oe=69FC9DBF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Formula X: Grand Prix Car Racing Legends", "keywords": ["Formula", "Racing", "F1", "Sport", "GrandPrix"], "long_description": "Become the leader of the track in your own lightning-fast Formula machine! Formula X throws you into the heart of VR motorsport, where speed, precision, & split-second decisions define every victory.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 PURE FORMULA RACING THRILL \ud83c\udfc1\nStrap into the cockpit and feel every vibration, curve, and burst of acceleration.\nMaster tight corners, chase the perfect racing line, & pull off bold overtakes with smooth, responsive VR controls.\nEvery surface affects traction \u2014 grip the road like a true pro!\n\n\ud83e\udd16 CHALLENGING AI COMPETITION \ud83e\udd16\nFace intelligent, competitive opponents who adapt to your driving.\nThey fight for positions, defend aggressively, push you to race smarter and faster.\n\n\u26d4 TRACK AWARENESS SYSTEMS \u26d4\nStay in the zone with wrong-way alerts and clean driving indicators that keep the pace intense & focused.\n\n\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f CONQUER SIGNATURE FORMULA CIRCUITS \ud83d\udee3\ufe0f\nRace across a collection of handcrafted VR tracks \u2014 from high-speed straights to technical twists.\nEach circuit brings new challenges & stunning environments built for full immersion.\n\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f DRIVE YOUR OWN FORMULA MACHINE \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f\nUnlock multiple high-performance cars, each tuned with unique handling, acceleration, & braking profiles.\nFeel the difference instantly as you push each machine to its limits.\n\nEach mode sharpens your skills as you rise from newcomer to racing legend.\n\nStep into Formula X & experience the intensity, precision, & adrenaline of true VR Formula racing.\nRev up, hit the asphalt, & chase your legacy at full throttle!", "short_description": "Feel the rush of Formula X VR racing with thrilling Grand Prix speed, smooth car control, and stunning visuals that pull you onto the track. Battle sharp AI rivals, grip every corner with dynamic traction, and stay alert as wrong-way warnings test your reflexes. Power through immersive circuits, execute perfect pit-stops, and unleash pure F1-style adrenaline. With fast action, intense competition, and a true racing vibe, the ultimate VR motorsport experience begins the moment you take the wheel."}]}, "developer_name": 